MEDICAL & CLINICAL AI DISCLAIMER

AppealForge is an assistive software tool that leverages artificial intelligence
(including DeepSeek and Qwen models) to facilitate the drafting and auditing of
health insurance appeal packages.

1. NOT MEDICAL OR LEGAL ADVICE:
   This software is intended solely for administrative workflow optimization. It
   does not constitute medical diagnosis, treatment recommendations, or formal
   legal representation.

2. MANDATORY HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP (HITL) VERIFICATION:
   While the dual-model architecture (Drafter + Clinical Auditor) actively detects
   discrepancies, all generated appeal letters, clinical codes (CPT/ICD-10), and
   coverage citations (CMS NCD/LCD) must be independently reviewed, verified, and
   approved by a qualified healthcare or revenue cycle professional prior to
   submission.

3. DATA PRIVACY & COMPLIANCE:
   Users are responsible for ensuring that their deployment and handling of
   Protected Health Information (PHI) complies with applicable regulations
   (including HIPAA, GDPR, and local privacy laws).
